  "uiAdaptation": "Only the five author sourceColors are inputs. bg-input=bg; bg-raised and btn-hover-bg are 4% text blended into bg; text-dim and border are 85% text blended into bg. Accents/status colors blend toward text in whole percentage points until >=4.6:1 on both surfaces. Rounded sRGB channels. Runtime uses reviewed literals, not a contrast engine. Atom uses original syntax colors instead of collection terminal adjustments; Dawn uses the author palette text #464261 instead of collection #575279. Collection bright ANSI/selection colors are not imported."
